    '@type': 'Question',
    name: 'Can I share business logic between an iOS app and an Android app with Traverse?',
    acceptedAnswer: {
      '@type': 'Answer',
      text: 'Not through a shipped Traverse SDK on both sides today. iOS now has a production runtime bridge — a wasmi-based Swift host, certified under ADR-0014 and ADR-0015 — while Android has a working, unreleased Kotlin runtime bridge still pending Compose reference-app integration. The capability and contract you write today carry over unchanged once both embedders ship on equal footing — the logic-sharing goal is real, just not equally mature on both mobile OSes yet.',
